+# notification-support
+
+Routes notification support actions through one Appwrite Function for the Appwrite Free tier two-function architecture.
+
+Supported actions:
+
+* `sendValidation`
+* `receiveValidation`
+* `receipt`
+
+Appwrite Console settings:
+
+* Runtime: Node.js TypeScript
+* Root directory: `functions/notification-support`
+* Build command: `npm install && npm run build`
+* Entry point: `dist/notification-support/src/main.js`
+* Execute access: authenticated users
+
+Request envelope:
+
+```json
+{
+  "action": "receipt",
+  "payload": {}
+}
+```
